    "text": "Meltdown Mode Activated: Newsom Isn’t Just Clapping Back He’s Rewriting the Map\nGuess we’ve got the face of the Democratic Party now. Gavin Newsom didn’t wait for a coronation he earned it by sending MAGA’s PR machine into full-blown panic mode. One social post at a time, he’s turned Fox News into a 24/7 meltdown montage.\nAnd now, if Texas follows through with its mid-decade redistricting stunt, Newsom’s ready to flip California seats in response. That’s not just retaliation, it’s blueprint warfare.\nNew York and Illinois are watching. Other states are warming up. The map isn’t just being redrawn, it’s being reclaimed.\nUnlike Trump and his MAGA echo chamber, Newsom doesn’t need a teleprompter tantrum or a grievance tour. He’s smart. He speaks. He leads. And MAGA knows it.\nThis isn’t just a political moment; it’s a narrative shift. The kind that turns comment threads into classrooms and troll bait into teachable legacy.",
